// The commander designation ([CR#903.3]): an OBJECT designation — "an
// attribute of the card itself", retained even across zone changes (hence
// `Permanently` persistence, not `ObjectLifetime`). A deck may designate two
// carriers ([CR#702.124b] partner commanders), so no uniqueness.
// A registry row for a designation OUTSIDE the curated engine table: the
// open vocabulary gains load-time scope enforcement through the row alone.
Designation(
    name: "commander",
    params: [],
    spelling: "commander",
    grammar: FixedTerm(surface: "commander"),
    body: [
        Designation(label: "commander", scope: HeldByCard, effectful: false, zone: None, type: None, half: None),
    ],
)
